    "Summary": "Ports the Dear ImGui 1.91 immediate-mode GUI to C#: windows, widgets, tables, plots and a full demo window.",
    "Description": "A C# port of the Dear ImGui 1.91 API, rendered through s&box's Painter. Call the static ImGui class from any component's OnUpdate; ImGuiSystem starts and draws the frame for you. Drop-in components show the demo window or inspect another component's properties without code. Needs no other libraries.",
